; worldenter.eval — in and out of a dungeon through the world map (P4).
;
; Two things it is really watching:
;
;   - `reset` must leave the party in a LEVEL — the harness ground, named in
;     project.ini. A new game opens in the starter dungeon or on the world map,
;     and if reset ever inherited either, the combat suites would start
;     measuring somewhere they were not written for.
;   - an UNDISCOVERED location cannot be entered. The script discovers the gate
;     explicitly, and the refusal before it is deliberate evidence that
;     discovery is a gate rather than decoration.
logecho on
reset
state
mapinfo

; --- out to the world -------------------------------------------------------
leave
state
world

; --- the gate: unknown places cannot be entered -----------------------------
enter crypt_gate

; --- and once found, they can -----------------------------------------------
discover crypt_gate
enter crypt_gate
state
mapinfo
world
